Package: sentixr
Title: Lexicons and Tools for Italian Sentiment Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Lexicons and tools to perform sentiment analysis on Italian texts. Lexicons included: Sentix 3.0, MAL, ElIta VAD and basic emotions (Plutchik's wheel of emotions).
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5),
    dplyr,
    tidyselect,
    rlang
Imports: udpipe
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    tidytext,
